# Multi-reviewer PRs (SunCulture)

When the user asks to add reviewers or when opening a PR that needs human review:

1. Request **more than one** reviewer unless they explicitly want a single person.
2. Resolve each handle to its canonical login before requesting:
   `gh api users/<handle> -q .login` (e.g. `baraka-mulumia` → `Baraka-Mulumia`,
   `kelvinnjoseph` → `KelvinNJoseph`).
3. Prefer `Devops/scripts/request-pr-reviewers/request-pr-reviewers.sh OWNER/REPO PR login…`
   (or the REST `requested_reviewers` API with a JSON array of resolved logins).
4. Do **not** use `@SunCulture/the-unit` team requests — Free org plan ignores them.
5. After requesting, verify with `gh pr view <n> --json reviewRequests` and report
   who was actually requested. If anyone is missing, say so and retry with the
   canonical login.
